[
    {
        "content": "<p>Hello,</p>\n<p>i have question on the plans for <code>Std.Http</code> compression support. Currently there is no compression support, and i'm asking myself if there are any plans to support gzip compression (for Body.Full and Body.Stream).</p>\n<p>If the answer is yes, would it be based on <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"110087\">@Kim Morrison</span>  zlib implementation or the <code>c</code> one ?<br>\nIf the answer is no, that compression support should be done by higher level libraries like LeanIO, what is the proper level to do it? because at the moment it's not obvious to me how to add support for it in a generic way, given the type erased <code>Body.Any</code>.<br>\nAny guidance ?</p>",
        "id": 609319322,
        "sender_full_name": "Alfredo Moreira-Rosa",
        "timestamp": 1783629357
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>One idea, would be to have <code>Body.any</code> being pipable to another Body. An example with LeanIO middleware</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">compress</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">next</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">HandlerSig</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">HandlerSig</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">req</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">req</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">line</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">headers</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">acceptEncoding</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">none</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">next</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">req</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">encodings</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">encodings</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"gzip\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">res</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">next</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">req</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">res</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">body</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">res</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">body</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pipeTrough</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">gZipCompressor</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">next</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">req</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Where gZipCompressor could be just function from Chunk to Chunk or be an object that satisfy a Transform class. This is the same interface / idea as NodeJs.<br>\nWhat do you think ?</p>",
        "id": 609603840,
        "sender_full_name": "Alfredo Moreira-Rosa",
        "timestamp": 1783770999
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>An example of a Transform class :</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TransformM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">StateT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Async</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Transform</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">transform</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Chunk</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TransformM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Chunk</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>And implementation of pipeThrough  using this interface :</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pipeThrough</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Transform</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">self</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Body</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Any</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">initial</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Body</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Stream</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Body</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">stream</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outStream</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">state</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">initial</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">repeat</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"k\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">self</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">recv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">chunk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">transformed</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nextState</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Transform</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">transform</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">chunk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">state</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">state</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nextState</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">outStream</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">send</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">transformed</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">none</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">break</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 609610697,
        "sender_full_name": "Alfredo Moreira-Rosa",
        "timestamp": 1783779001
    }
